Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}How can we group connected cells without making any cluster too large?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}如何把连接紧密的电路单元分组，同时避免任何簇过大？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:10.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}This lesson explains size-constrained agglomerative clustering through one small graph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:10.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}本课通过一个小图，讲解带大小约束的凝聚式聚类。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:16.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}We will follow merges, measure cutsize, and explain why the algorithm can stop early.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:16.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}我们将跟踪合并过程、计算割边权重总和，并解释算法为何有时提前停止。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:21.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}By the end, you should be able to reproduce the result and report its limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:21.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}学完后，你应能复现结果，并说明它的局限。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:27.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}In this simplified E D A model, each node represents a cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:27.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}在这个简化的电子设计自动化模型中，每个节点代表一个电路单元。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:32.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}An edge weight describes connectivity: a larger weight means a stronger connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:32.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}边权表示连接强度：权重越大，连接越强。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}A node also has a size, which can represent cell area rather than node count.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}节点还有大小属性，可以代表单元面积，而不只是节点个数。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:43.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Here every node has size one, so cluster size equals its number of members.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:43.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}这里每个节点的大小都是一，因此簇大小等于成员个数。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:50.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Real netlists may use hypergraphs; this lab deliberately uses an undirected weighted graph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:50.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}真实网表可能使用超图；本实验特意采用无向加权图。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:54.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Target K is the desired number of clusters at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:54.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}目标 K 表示最终期望得到的簇数。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.67,0:00:59.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Capacity is a hard upper limit on the total size inside each cluster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.67,0:00:59.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}容量是每个簇内总大小不可超过的上限。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.59,0:01:05.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}With capacity two, two unit-size cells fit together, but a third cell does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.59,0:01:05.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}容量为二时，两个大小为一的单元可以合并，但不能再加入第三个。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.70,0:01:10.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}A small cutsize does not make an oversized cluster legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.70,0:01:10.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}割边权重总和较小，并不能让超容量的簇变得合法。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.07,0:01:15.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}We must report whether the algorithm actually reaches K while respecting capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.07,0:01:15.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}我们必须报告算法在遵守容量约束的同时，是否真的达到目标 K。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:20.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Affinity measures how strongly two current clusters are connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:20.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}亲和度衡量当前两个簇之间的连接强度。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.74,0:01:25.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Add every original edge weight that connects one cluster to the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.74,0:01:25.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}将连接这两个簇的所有原始边权相加。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.31,0:01:31.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Cutsize adds all edges whose endpoints belong to different clusters, counting each edge once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.31,0:01:31.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}割边权重总和统计端点位于不同簇的全部边，每条边只计一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.73,0:01:36.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}When two clusters merge, their connecting edges become internal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.73,0:01:36.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}两个簇合并后，它们之间的边就变成簇内边。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.27,0:01:42.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}So cutsize falls by exactly their affinity; no other partition boundary changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.27,0:01:42.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}因此割边权重总和恰好减少两簇的亲和度，其他分组边界不变。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:48.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Start with one cluster per node, then consider pairs with positive affinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:48.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}从每个节点各自成簇开始，只考虑亲和度为正的簇对。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:53.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Discard pairs that would exceed capacity, and choose the strongest remaining pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:53.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}排除合并后超容量的簇对，再选择剩余候选中亲和度最高的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:02:00.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}For ties, sort the members within each cluster, then order the two clusters lexicographically.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:02:00.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}出现平局时，先对每个簇的成员标签排序，再按字典序排列簇对。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.22,0:02:05.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Compare the first member list, then the second; the smallest pair wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.22,0:02:05.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}先比较第一个成员列表，再比较第二个，字典序最小的簇对优先。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:11.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Our slides and code share this rule; upstream instead uses synthetic cluster identifiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:11.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}本课幻灯片与两种实现统一使用这条规则；上游则使用生成的簇编号。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:18.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Initially, all five nodes are separate, so every edge crosses a cluster boundary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:18.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}初始时五个节点各自成簇，因此每条边都跨越簇边界。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.33,0:02:22.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The six edge weights add to eighteen, which is our initial cutsize.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.33,0:02:22.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}六条边的权重之和为十八，这就是初始割边权重总和。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.99,0:02:27.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Nodes A and B, and nodes D and E, each have affinity five.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.99,0:02:27.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}A 与 B、D 与 E 的亲和度都是五。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:32.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Our tie-break first merges nodes A and B, with combined size two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}按照平局规则，先合并 A 与 B，合并后的大小为二。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.76,0:02:38.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Their edge becomes internal, reducing cutsize from eighteen to thirteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.76,0:02:38.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}它们之间的边变为簇内边，使割边权重总和从十八降到十三。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:44.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Contraction replaces A and B by one current cluster while retaining both original members.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:44.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}收缩操作将 A 和 B 替换为一个当前簇，同时保留两个原始成员。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:49.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The new connection to C combines the old A to C and B to C edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:49.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}新簇与 C 的连接需要合并原来的 A 到 C、B 到 C 两条边。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:53.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Their weights are one and four, giving affinity five.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:53.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}两条边的权重分别为一和四，因此亲和度为五。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:59.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Do not keep only the largest edge, and do not reuse a stale candidate ranking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:59.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}不能只保留最大的那条边，也不能继续使用过时的候选排序。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:04.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The next choice must use these updated affinities and the updated cluster sizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}下一次选择必须使用更新后的亲和度与簇大小。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:08.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Now set target K to two and capacity to two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:08.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}现在将目标 K 设为二，容量也设为二。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:14.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Although the A B cluster connects strongly to C, combining them would create size three.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:14.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}虽然 A、B 所在簇与 C 的连接很强，合并后大小却会达到三。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:19.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}That merge is illegal, so we skip it and consider the next candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:19.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}这次合并不合法，因此跳过它，继续检查下一个候选。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:24.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}D and E can merge legally, reducing cutsize by another five to eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:24.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}D 与 E 可以合法合并，割边权重总和再减少五，变为八。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:30.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Nodes A and B form one cluster, C remains alone, and nodes D and E form another.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:30.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}A 与 B 组成一簇，C 单独成簇，D 与 E 组成另一簇。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}We now have three clusters, and none of the remaining positive-affinity merges is legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}现在有三个簇，剩余亲和度为正的合并都不合法。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:41.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The algorithm stops even though target K is two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:41.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}虽然目标 K 为二，算法仍必须停止。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}This target is fundamentally infeasible: two clusters of capacity two hold only four units.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}这个目标本身不可行：两个容量为二的簇最多容纳四个大小单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:53.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Our graph contains five units, so no algorithm can satisfy both requirements.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:53.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}图中共有五个大小单位，因此任何算法都无法同时满足这两个要求。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:59.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The result respects capacity, but target reached must be reported as false.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:59.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}结果符合容量约束，但“是否达到目标”必须报告为否。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:05.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Restart from singletons, keeping target K at two but increasing capacity to three.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:05.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}重新从单节点簇开始，保持目标 K 为二，把容量提高到三。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:11.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}After merging nodes A and B, their cluster can now legally absorb node C.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:11.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}合并 A 与 B 后，它们所在的簇现在可以合法吸收 C。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:16.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}This ties with D and E, but our rule first merges the A B cluster with C.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:16.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}它的亲和度与 D、E 簇对相同，成员标签规则优先选择前者。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:22.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Then D and E merge, leaving two clusters: A with B and C, and D with E.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:22.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}随后合并 D 与 E，最终得到 A、B、C 一簇和 D、E 一簇。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:27.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Only the C to D and C to E edges cross, so cutsize is three.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:27.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}只有 C 到 D、C 到 E 两条边跨簇，因此割边权重总和为三。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.34,0:04:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Without a capacity limit, target K of two produces the same partition and cutsize three.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.34,0:04:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}没有容量限制时，目标 K 为二仍得到相同分组，割边权重总和为三。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:39.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}With capacity two, the result has three clusters and cutsize eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}容量为二时，结果有三个簇，割边权重总和为八。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:45.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The difference of five comes exactly from A to C and B to C becoming cross-cluster edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:45.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}多出的五，恰好来自 A 到 C 和 B 到 C 两条边变成跨簇边。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.67,0:04:52.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}If target K is three instead, that same capacity-two result successfully reaches the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.67,0:04:52.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}如果目标 K 改为三，那么同一个容量为二的结果就成功达到目标。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:59.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}For a small teaching graph, recomputing affinities from original edges is a clear implementation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:59.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}对于教学小图，从原始边重新计算亲和度是一种清晰的实现方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:05.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}After each merge, update membership and sizes, then rebuild the candidate list.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:05.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}每次合并后，更新成员关系和大小，再重建候选列表。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:11.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}One blocked candidate does not justify stopping; another legal pair may still exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:11.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}一个候选被容量阻止，并不意味着可以停止；可能还有其他合法簇对。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.39,0:05:16.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Stop at K, or when every positive-affinity candidate is illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.39,0:05:16.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}达到 K 时停止，或者在所有正亲和度候选都不合法时停止。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Our reference rejects invalid sizes and never forces a zero-affinity merge just to reach K.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}参考实现拒绝无效大小，也不会为了凑够 K 而强行合并零亲和度簇对。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:28.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Now consider a different graph with sizes two, two, one, and one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:28.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}现在看另一个图，四个节点大小分别为二、二、一、一。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.81,0:05:33.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The strongest edge joins C and D, so greedy merges them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.81,0:05:33.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}最强的边连接 C 与 D，因此贪心算法先合并它们。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.79,0:05:40.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}All three remaining clusters have size two, and capacity three blocks every further merge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.79,0:05:40.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}剩下的三个簇大小都为二，容量三使后续任何合并都不合法。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.03,0:05:46.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Yet pairing node A with C, and node B with D, gives two legal clusters of size three.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.03,0:05:46.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}但 A 与 C、B 与 D 分别成簇，就能得到两个大小为三的合法簇。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.27,0:05:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Here the target is feasible; the greedy history, not total available capacity, causes the failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.27,0:05:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}这里目标是可行的；失败源于贪心选择的历史，而不是总容量不足。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:59.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}In this four-node example, every size is one and capacity is two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:59.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}在这个四节点例子中，每个节点大小为一，容量为二。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:04.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Greedy takes the weight-ten A B edge, then the weight-one C D edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:04.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}贪心先选择权重十的 A、B 边，再选择权重一的 C、D 边。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.03,0:06:09.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The result reaches K legally, but its cross-cluster edges sum to eighteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.03,0:06:09.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}结果合法达到 K，但跨簇边的权重总和为十八。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:14.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Pairing node A with C, and node B with D, instead gives cutsize eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:14.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}如果改为 A 与 C、B 与 D 分别成簇，割边权重总和只有十一。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:20.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}This better legal partition proves that greedy does not guarantee global optimality.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:20.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}这个更好的合法分组说明：贪心算法不保证全局最优。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}In the interactive lab, predict the next merge before revealing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:25.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}在交互实验中，先预测下一次合并，再查看结果。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:30.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Run all four parameter settings and explain each stopping condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:30.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}运行四组参数，并解释每组为什么停止。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.23,0:06:35.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Then complete the Python exercise and compare it with the reference traces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.23,0:06:35.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}随后完成 Python 实现练习，并与参考轨迹比较。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.22,0:06:42.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Report actual cluster count, cutsize, sizes, capacity compliance, and whether K was reached.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.22,0:06:42.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}记录实际簇数、割边权重总和、各簇大小、容量是否合规，以及是否达到 K。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:48.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Passing a quiz checks understanding, but does not replace implementation or maintenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}测验通过可以检验理解，但本身不能替代实现任务或课程维护交付。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:54.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Affinity guides the choice, while capacity determines which choices are legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:54.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}亲和度指导选择，容量决定哪些选择合法。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:07:00.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Contraction changes the graph, so every later decision must use updated information.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:07:00.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}收缩会改变图，因此后续决策必须使用更新后的信息。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:06.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}A legal partition, reaching the target, and global optimality are three different outcomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:06.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}始终区分分组合法、达到目标和全局最优这三件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.74,0:07:11.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The five-node example comes from Yongfu Li's E D A learning course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.74,0:07:11.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}本课的五节点例子来自 Yongfu Li 的 EDA learning 课程。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:18.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}This lesson adds new explanations, narration, bilingual captions, and reproducible exercises.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:18.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}本课新增讲解、配音、双语字幕与可复现实验。
